noreferrer">
https://blaisekelly.github.io/B3108_speeds/journey_time.html</a>. I am not =
sure what weight it had but they have been successful in reducing the limit=
, despite being originally told there were not enough fatalities.</div>
<div style=3D"font-size:small">&nbsp; <br>
