<div style=3D"font-size:small"><br>
</div>
<div style=3D"font-size:small">I don't really think Google ar bothered beca=
use they&nbsp;don=E2=80=99t offer this data at all (apart from via the Dist=
ance Matrix) and it is my understanding their T&amp;Cs are more focused on =
people copying Google maps rather than people using
 Google maps data and actually promoting their product.<br>
Not a PhD topic but the ability to get congestion data for anywhere is usef=
ul and I would like to work more on developing these tools, maybe using sat=
ellite data etc.<br>
</div>
<div style=3D"font-size:small"><br>
